personality_notes = "Elvin, şahın gölgedeki oğlu — the King's illegitimate son, Aras's half-brother.
Grief stance: the forgotten living — the King kept his dead son and forgot his living one.
Wants to be seen. Hub aşık: sings Aras's story, including what Aras burned (recap songs).
Meets his father in Act III; the King does not recognise him. Lost one: his mother, a singer the King never acknowledged [TBD name].
See STORY_BIBLE.md §7."
